│ singleton pregnancies achieved by controlled ovarian stimulation, including 220 that had undergone IVF. Results were │
│ compared with 1233 singleton pregnancies conceived spontaneously. RESULTS In the IVF pregnancies, the median fetal   │
│ NT was not significantly different from that in controls, whilst the median free beta-HCG was significantly          │
│ increased, and PAPP-A was significantly decreased. In the intracytoplasmic sperm injection group, fetal NT and free  │
