│ those pregnancies achieved by ovarian stimulation, neither fetal NT, free beta-HCG nor PAPP-A were significantly     │
│ different from the control group. CONCLUSIONS In IVF pregnancies, screening for trisomy 21 by fetal NT, maternal     │
