│     "abstract": "AIM To evaluate the prevalence of increased nuchal translucency (NT) in multiple pregnancies and    │
│ its relation to fetal karyotype and pregnancy outcome. METHODS We measured fetal nuchal translucency (NT) in 6,338   │
