│     "abstract": "The aim of this study was to achieve one-stage screening for trisomy 21 using a combination of      │
│ nuchal translucency (NuT) measurement and maternal serum alpha-fetoprotein (AFP) and free beta-human chorionic       │
│ gonadotrophin (hCG) biochemistry levels in the second trimester among a high-risk study population. From January     │
