│ levels in cases of Down syndrome were 0.44 MOM at 9 weeks gestation, 0.15 MOM at 10 weeks, and 0.29 MOM at 11 weeks. │
│ The PAPP-A level at 10 weeks was below those of pregnancies which aborted spontaneously. At 11 weeks, the            │
