urinary beta-core hCG will be a useful marker in Down syndrome screening practice. But the considerable variability in 
results between studies means that further research is needed before a reliable conclusion can be drawn."}, 
{"study_index": 411, "title": "First‐trimester placental volume as a marker for chromosomal anomalies: preliminary 
